  "transport_limitations": [
    "One active trigger per verified bot account in one Langflow database. Each bot must be dedicated to one installation because Telegram provides no cross-installation receiver coordination.",
    "Webhooks support hosted and self-managed public HTTPS ingress. Polling supports self-managed and Desktop, never simultaneously with a registered bot webhook.",
    "New text messages and commands only. Channel posts, edits, attachments, callbacks, business messages, anonymous senders, and bot messages are excluded.",
    "Only is_topic_message=true marks message_thread_id as a reply destination. Supported topics include forum supergroups and private chats with bot forum mode enabled.",
    "Pending provider updates expire after 24 hours. One getUpdates page commits with its next offset before any subsequent confirmation request.",
    "Manual BotFather tokens have no OAuth scopes or automatic refresh. Complete cleanup before revoking or rotating tokens.",
    "Live Telegram account acceptance and production replica failover have not been verified."
  ],
